{"id":"598332415","kind":"article","title":"可探索的解释","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explorable_explanation"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-01-11","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":786,"keywords":["可探索解释","数学教育","交互式学习","证明策略","认知工具"],"summary":"作者围绕“可探索解释”提出若干疑问：它建立在有限对象假设上，是否能容纳无穷、不可行及语言原生的数学知识？现有作品是否偏向易互动的题材，而回避更值得解释的内容？作者还希望用由浅入深的谜题帮助读者掌握复杂概念，并探索让工具辅助练习高层次证明策略的可能。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/598332415","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"另见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"外部链接"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"XMDX3rQU\">我想在这里提一些关于可探索的解释的主张/意见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"QDBHZ0_q\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Finiteness_assumption_in_explorable_media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「可探索解释」的概念建立在有穷性的假设上</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，但在数学中，你经常要处理<b>任意对象</b> 、各种无穷大、以及<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Representing_impossibilities\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">表示不可能的情况</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup> （例如在反证法中）以及其他「无穷」的事物。到底要怎么做，才能在可探索解释的框架内，讨论这些涉及无穷/不可能的事物？<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"-1qcXfBd\"> 在选材上，现有的可探索解释材料，往往选择最容易用可探索的形式表达的领域，而非找出最值得解释的知识，然后花费气力，用可探索的形式表达出来。这意味着可探索解释常常让人感觉是无关痛痒的花哨玩意。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/The_Witness\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">见证者</a>是漂亮而凄美的，但你最终只是在面板上画波浪线来解决人造（=鸡毛蒜皮的玩意）规则带来的问题。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"ylgPi5U1\"> 可探索解释通常只能承载非语言的知识？这个属性很有趣，但也导致可探索解释比较难以用于数理逻辑这种<b>语言原生</b>的知识领域。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"P96sfbtt\"> 让可探索解释代劳那些无聊而繁重的智力劳动，目前则是由数学家手动完成的——比如，写好证明框架，验证某个算式时进行的低层次计算等。我特别感兴趣的是，如何借助这些工具来练习如何选择高层次的证明策略。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"Csoo5j8u\"> 很少有可探索解释使用一系列的谜题，从简单的概念出发，逐步解释复杂概念，在我印象里，除了视频游戏之外，都没有这么做的。因此可探索解释也就缺乏「连续深度」，因此就令人感觉花哨无比，对于理解主题无关紧要。<br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-1\">另见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"7cXNzPKn\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏 vs 数学</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"4B83GyRD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Probability_and_statistics_as_fields_with_an_exploratory_medium\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索媒介作为概率与统计的学习媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"f1TdwrG9\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Narrow_vs_broad_cognitive_augmentation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">狭域认知增强与广域认知增强</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">外部链接</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"SIAtq0G1\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.comhttps//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Explorable_explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">维基百科:Explorable explanation</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"AGBsV2V7\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Finiteness_assumption_in_explorable_media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索媒介的有限对象假设</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Finiteness+assumption+in+explorable+media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"QpHY6TsL\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Representing_impossibilities\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">表示不可能的情况</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Representing+impossibilities\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"gdJuHwLK\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Narrow_vs_broad_cognitive_augmentation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Narrow+vs+broad+cognitive+augmentation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"dPuqMi3O\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Comparison_of_pedagogical_scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教学场景对比</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Comparison+of+pedagogical+scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"RanYIl6l\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者偶然奇怪、校对 Shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explorable_explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Explorable explanation</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 可探索媒介中的有限性假设 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"666393432\" href=\"#/post/666393432\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 表示不可能的情况 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"592187312\" href=\"#/post/592187312\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 对比数学与电子游戏 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"716414197\" href=\"#/post/716414197\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 概率和统计是具有可探索媒介的领域 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"618757945\" href=\"#/post/618757945\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"597533071\" href=\"#/post/597533071\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"597533071","title":"对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"598758768","title":"如何促使人们创作更多优秀的解释文章？一些策略及其背后的假设","author":"Issa Rice","votes":37,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"666393432","title":"可探索媒介中的有限性假设","author":"Issa Rice","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"716414197","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"618757945","title":"概率和统计是具有可探索媒介的领域","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2975567430","title":"在学校里，教师应不应该阻止学生提出表面上看似是「胡思乱想」、「愚蠢」、和「无意义」的问题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":130,"minutes":8,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 130 赞同","evidence":"回答以锚文本「Thoughts Memo：可探索的解释」直接指向目标译文；该锚文本是可辨认的标题或主题词。"},{"id":"2984069166","title":"如何科学评价一本教材？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":98,"minutes":16,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 98 赞同","evidence":"相关阅读链接卡显示目标译文标题“Thoughts Memo：可探索的解释”，可唯一定位。"}]}